note right of DAO6
Owns connection/config, not every business responsibility.
Default constructor owns con; Connection constructor borrows.
Test mode verifies actual catalog before business SQL.
end note
note right of Vehicle6
ID before save is null. Derived getVehicleCode is null-safe.
currentMileage/manufactureYear: Integer nullable.
No physical vehicleCode column.
end note
note right of BookingServlet6
Session bookingContexts: Map of context UUID to Map<String,Object>.
Each map retains id/date/vehicleId/slotId/requestDescription,
draft, holdCode, holdExpiresAt and completed; synchronize per map.
Servlet constructs draft after successful hold; final confirmation reuses it.
end note
note right of AppointmentDAO6
One transaction: consume token + ownership FOR SHARE + valid placeholder INSERT
+ generated key + final LH UPDATE + graph readback + commit.
Generated unique activeSlotId stays in DB, not an entity setter.
end note
